              "type": "quest_available",
              "value": 200
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "option_id": 2,
          "text": "What is under the stones?",
          "next_page": 2
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page_num": 2,
      "text": "What a question. What a wonderfully answered-for-you question.\n\nGo and see the sentry at the south gate. Tell her nothing interesting.",
      "options": [
        {
          "option_id": 1,
          "text": "I will go.",
          "next_page": -1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page_num": 3,
      "text": "You came here without being sent. I like that. It will get you hurt, but I like it.\n\nThe Warden first. Then come back and we will pretend this never happened.",
      "options": [
        {
          "option_id": 1,
          "text": "The Warden, then.",
